Sheng, compact sampler or drum machine, dry batida kick/clap/tom programming, bass marimba, restrained sine sub, prepared viola, woodblock, low conga, palm-muted frame drum, shell clicks, short tape echo, narrow room reverb, close sheng stereo pair, bridge microphone on viola, and light tape saturation.

